# Automation for Lattice-generation and FEM Simulation

This is pipeline to automate lattice-based struture generation and FEM simulation

### Structure
- CAD_file: store CAD model of nose cone and 
- DYNA_file: contains k files to run LS-DYNA solver 
- nTop_file: contains nTop templates to generate lattice structures
- scripts: code files

## Main process to create simulation 
This is example of running process for . User can combine and customize their own running loop

1. Modify nTop file template with given parameters to generate FE models. Remember to login nTop before run
- [generate_k_file_from_nTop](scripts/generate_k_file_from_nTop.ipynb)

2. Pre-process to setup completed k file for LS-DYNA from FE mesh and run simulation
- [setup_k_file_and_run](scripts/setup_k_file_and_run.ipynb) 

3. Post-process to get HIC from d3plot
- [get_HIC](scripts/get_HIC.ipynb) 


## Python Requirements

Install the Python dependencies with:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```